OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 12 JAN
OL,4,G0630FBreakfast
OL,5,     GTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,6,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,7,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,8,G0930FRadio 3's American Roadtrip
OL,9,     GGeorgia Mann presents live from
OL,10,     Gthe City of Angels, including a
OL,11,     Gvisit to the Hollywood Walk of
OL,12,     GFame, and live music from film
OL,13,     Gmusic pianist and conductor,
OL,14,     GScott Dunn.
OL,15,G1300FClassical Live
OL,16,     GElizabeth Alker showcases the
OL,17,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,18,     Gbeyond including the Casals
OL,19,     GQuartet playing Bach and
OL,20,     GShostakovich and orchestral music
OL,21,     Gfrom great American composers.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
