OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 12 JAN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Copland
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod traces Copland's
OL,6,     Glater years as conductor and
OL,7,     Gchronicler.
OL,8,G1700FIn Tune
OL,9,     GKatie Derham is joined by
OL,10,     Gviolinist Roman Mints for a live
OL,11,     Gperformance in studio, linked to
OL,12,     GLondon's Another Music Festival:
OL,13,     GDisplaced - which Roman curates.
OL,14,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,15,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,16,     Gsoundscape of classical music by
OL,17,     GGjeilo, Brahms, and Mangore.
